      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:59:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>ImageCompress 2026.11.23.1 stops offering the update you already installed, and imgcompress --version now shows the release number.</p><ul><li>Show the release version in imgcompress --version, and fix build warnings</li><li>Give the app its real version number, so Sparkle stops offering the installed release</li><li>Draft the release summary with claude -p directly instead of the cldp shell alias</li><li>Ask for 1Password approval at the start of a release, and retry timed-out prompts</li></ul>]]></description>
